*Song on Fire* is the one film showing at the [[Geography/Black and White/Soundscape Theaters|Soundscape Theaters]] on the [[Geography/Black and White/Plaza|plaza]] in the [[Geography/Black and White/index|Black and White]]. Its closing credits bill Helena Ashcroft as the Spark, [[Org/Roundhat Gang/People/Tywelwyn Leatherhide|Tywelwyn Leatherhide]] as the Kindling, Elara Vance as the Antenna, and [[Divinity/Ashen Pact/Pyre|Pyre]] as the Outer God.

The Spark is the name of the man who leads [[Org/Pyrelight/index|Pyrelight]] in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Teller's Run/index|Teller's Run]]. Helena Ashcroft is a name the Party does not know.
